WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:05.580
President Lyndon Johnson added the&nbsp;
title grandfather to his other honors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:13.170
when daughter Lucy Nugent bore a son the baby was&nbsp;
baptized with the President himself as Godfather

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.920
The first White House wedding in half a century&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:24.080
took place in December. Linda Johnson&nbsp;
married Marine Captain Charles Robb

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.720
The happy couple departed&nbsp;
for a Caribbean honeymoon.

